  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-9660 - (SIRENE) Strengthening Indonesia&#x2019;s Reduction and Elimination in the Distribution and Supply Chain of Mercury from National Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SIRENE project supports Indonesia&#x2019;s transition away from mercury-containing medical devices through strengthened policy and regulatory frameworks, enhanced technical and institutional capacities of stakeholders, improved environmentally sound management of mercury-containing waste, and the development of circular models to promote sustainable adoption of mercury-free alternatives.</narrative>
  </description>
